{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32899","headline":"早秋书怀 · 李郢","name":"早秋书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高梧一叶坠凉天，宋玉悲秋泪洒然。\n霜拂楚山频见菊，雨零溪树忽无蝉。\n虚村暮角催残日，近寺归僧寄野泉。\n青鬓已缘多病镊，可堪风景促流年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}